            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-39206\"><b>Laurey 39206, Swirl Foundry Cabinet Knob in Antique Pewter</b></a>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith its rustic charm, the Foundry Antique Pewter Cabinet Knob is the ideal farmhouse kitchen hardware. The Swirl Foundry Cabinet Knob in Antique Pewter comes packaged with the mounting hardware. This kitchen cabinet pull has a 1-1/4 inch diameter and a 1 inch projection.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet knob is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Foundry\">Laurey Foundry Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey 39206 Antique Pewter Foundry Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Antique Pewter</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available finishes:</b>\r\n<table width=\"450\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-39206\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-39206-SM.jpg?v=1704354588\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-39206\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/foundry-oil-rubbed-bronze-cabinet-knob-laurey-39266\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-39266-SM.jpg?v=1704354588\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-39266\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/foundry-matte-black-cabinet-knob-laurey-39220\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-39220-SM.jpg?v=1704354588\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-39220\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"text\" align=\"center\">\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-39206\"><b>Antique Pewter</b></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/foundry-oil-rubbed-bronze-cabinet-knob-laurey-39266\"><b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/foundry-matte-black-cabinet-knob-laur